WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.090
- Hi everyone, Sal Khan here

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.930
for our daily homeroom.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.630
For those of y'all who are new to this,

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.300
Khan Academy, we are

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.510
not-for-profit with a mission

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:19.350
of providing a free world-class education

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.140
for anyone, anywhere.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:23.970
And when we saw the mass school closures,

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:25.030
not just in the United States,

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:25.900
but around the world,

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.520
there's now over 1.4 billion
students around the world

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:30.353
who normally would go

00:00:30.353 --> 00:00:31.640
to school, who aren't.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:32.787
We realized that above and beyond

00:00:32.787 --> 00:00:36.110
the resources that Khan Academy
has been creating for years,

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:37.380
and offering for free

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.360
for teachers, students and parents,

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.110
for students inside of classrooms

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:43.170
and outside of classrooms
around the world,

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:45.330
that it's our duty to step up and do more.

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:48.500
So we've been doing things like
parent and teacher webinars,

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.280
we've been publishing things

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.180
like the daily schedules
for different age groups,

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:55.130
that some of y'all might be familiar with.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:57.638
And we are also doing this livestream,

00:00:57.638 --> 00:01:00.360
and it's a way to stay connected

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.050
in this time of social distancing.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:02.940
It's a way

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:05.360
to answer any questions
that you might have,

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:09.190
and it's also a way to have
interesting conversations

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:11.930
that are related to
what's going on around us.

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:13.230
It could be related to education,

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:16.820
or it could be related to
just the broader environment.

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:18.042
I do wanna say a few thank you's.

00:01:18.042 --> 00:01:20.070
As I mentioned, we're a not-for-profit.

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:22.086
We're funded with philanthropic donations.

00:01:22.086 --> 00:01:26.680
Even before the COVID crisis
we were running at a deficit.

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:31.410
And now our traffic on Khan
Academy is about two and a half,

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:32.720
it looks like, I looked this morning,

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.580
it's about 2.8 what it normally is.

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:37.170
And so that only increases our cost.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:38.410
So if you're in a position to do so,

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:40.498
please think about helping us out,

00:01:40.498 --> 00:01:42.700
khanacademy.org/donate.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.140
And I wanna give a special thanks

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:46.260
to several corporations who stepped up

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.520
over the last couple of
weeks in record time,

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:51.064
to help us with this COVID response.

00:01:51.064 --> 00:01:53.640
These include folks like Bank of America,

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:54.910
which was the first to step up.

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:57.200
And shortly thereafter, AT&amp;T,

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.930
Google.org and NORVATIS.

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:01.390
And that's above and beyond
many of the foundations

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:04.134
and philanthropists and
corporations like AMGEN,

00:02:04.134 --> 00:02:07.371
that have funded Khan
Academy through the years.

00:02:07.371 --> 00:02:09.840
And as much as that funding helps,

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:10.830
I do wanna emphasize

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:11.820
that we still need more.

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:14.360
We're still operating at
a significant deficit.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.340
So funding at any level helps.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.626
Over the weekend I put
a video out on YouTube,

00:02:18.626 --> 00:02:21.490
