fifth grade on decimals,

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:10.050
now you're building on a weak foundation.

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:12.150
And that might be or that arguably is,

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:14.650
the reason why so many
people struggle in math,

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.350
and you see the data gets worse and worse,

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:18.393
the farther you get advanced,

00:10:18.393 --> 00:10:21.030
