to that sixth grade material,

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.370
now they're ready to move ahead,

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.370
and you do both of those simultaneously.

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:42.790
- Exactly, and this is life changing.

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:44.780
I encourage every parent at home

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:47.360
