00:26:10.410 --> 00:26:12.180
So Edward right now,

00:26:12.180 --> 00:26:13.890
we don't have that in theory,

00:26:13.890 --> 00:26:16.100
that could happen in the future.

00:26:16.100 --> 00:26:18.810
So it's definitely in
the realm of possibility.

00:26:18.810 --> 00:26:21.650
I would say that obviously
the UK system is,

00:26:21.650 --> 00:26:22.483
even in the US,

00:26:22.483 --> 00:26:24.784
state to state can be
a little bit different.

00:26:24.784 --> 00:26:25.680
It is different.

00:26:25.680 --> 00:26:27.040
But especially in math,

00:26:27.040 --> 00:26:30.060
if you master the
progression along the lines

00:26:30.060 --> 00:26:31.690
