00:26:35.730 --> 00:26:37.050
And there might be a few standards

00:26:37.050 --> 00:26:38.490
that are different here or there,

00:26:38.490 --> 00:26:40.230
you will have a very strong foundation

00:26:40.230 --> 00:26:43.117
and you'll feel yourself
very fluent in math.

00:26:43.117 --> 00:26:44.470
And the same thing is also true

00:26:44.470 --> 00:26:46.170
for things like biology, chemistry,

00:26:46.170 --> 00:26:47.860
physics, if you're thinking about things

00:26:47.860 --> 00:26:50.810
more at a high school
or early college level,

00:26:50.810 --> 00:26:51.643
so I encourage you to do that.

00:26:51.643 --> 00:26:54.360
But it is a good nudge first to think

00:26:54.360 --> 00:26:56.830
